  "description_short": "Casual riverside spot at Keurbooms bridge serving hearty meals with stunning water views.",
  "description_long": "Perched right at the Keurbooms River bridge on the N2, Riverside Restaurant offers a welcome break for travelers and locals alike. The setting is unbeatable – tables overlook the wide river where it meets the lagoon, with the Tsitsikamma mountains rising in the distance. It's the kind of place where you can watch kayakers paddle past while enjoying a relaxed meal.\n\nThe menu covers the basics well, from breakfast through to dinner, with a focus on South African comfort food and fresh seafood. Portions are generous and prices are fair, making it a solid choice for families. The atmosphere is laid-back and unpretentious, with both indoor seating and an outdoor deck that catches the breeze on warm days.\n\nWhile it's conveniently located right off the highway, the real draw is the position on the water. Whether you're stopping in for a quick coffee or settling in for a longer meal, the river views provide a proper sense of place that reminds you why this stretch of coast is so special.",
